@startuml
' REVIEWED_MAIN_2026_05_13: aligned to current merged code; large-investment retained pending simplification merge.
' LEGACY_NOTE_2026_05_13: this diagram may include historical ACL/receipt/tokenizer details pending upstream simplification merge; validate against current code before implementation decisions.
title ACL Gate Transfer Hook Validation

actor "User" as User

box "Token-2022 Program" #LightYellow
participant "Token-2022\n<<program>>" as TokenProgram
participant "vToken Mint\n<<with transfer hook>>" as VTokenMint
end box

box "Token ACL Program" #LightCyan
participant "Token ACL\n<<program>>" as TokenAcl
end box

box "ACL Gate Program\n(CPACLKiGDA9wD5LqoTuoxKiFdtToDAB6WpEEjUVZtb8v)" #LightGreen
participant "ACL Gate\n<<program>>" as AclGate
end box

box "Vault Program PDAs\n(EMDZftqHQgUkj2WB5zGDsGdShWu2GKG8qkhq8AwwSGxa)" #LightBlue
participant "Whitelist Entry\n<<PDA>>" as WhitelistEntry
end box

box "Token ACL PDAs" #LightCoral
participant "MINT_CONFIG\n<<PDA>>" as MintConfig
participant "FLAG_ACCOUNT\n<<PDA>>" as FlagAccount
end box

box "Token Accounts" #pink
participant "Source vToken\n<<account>>" as SourceVToken
participant "Dest vToken\n<<account>>" as DestVToken
end box

=== TRANSFER VALIDATION: User attempts vToken transfer ==

User -> TokenProgram : transfer(source, dest, amount)

note over TokenProgram
  Token-2022 detects transfer hook
  configured on vToken mint
end note

TokenProgram -> VTokenMint : read transfer_hook extension
VTokenMint --> TokenProgram : hook_program_id = ACL_GATE_ID

note over TokenProgram, AclGate
  Token-2022 invokes ACL Gate
  before executing transfer
end note

TokenProgram -> AclGate : <b>[[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs invoke transfer hook callback]]

note over AclGate
  ACL Gate determines if transfer
  should be allowed based on
  account freeze state
end note

=== SCENARIO A: Thaw Request (Unfreeze Account) ==

AclGate -> AclGate : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs process_acl_instruction]]
note over AclGate
  Discriminator matches:
  CanThawPermissionlessInstruction
end note

AclGate -> AclGate : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs can_thaw_permissionless]]

note over AclGate
  CHECK 1: Validate FLAG_ACCOUNT
end note

AclGate -> FlagAccount : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs assert_permissionless_flag]]
note right of FlagAccount
  Verify:
  - owner == Token ACL program
  - data[0] == 1 (flag set)
end note

alt Invalid Flag Account
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::InvalidFlagAccount
end

note over AclGate
  CHECK 2: Validate Vault Program ID
end note

AclGate -> AclGate : check vault_program.key == VAULT_PROGRAM_ID
alt Wrong Vault Program
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::InvalidWhitelistEntry
end

note over AclGate
  CHECK 3: Validate Extra Account Metas PDA
end note

AclGate -> AclGate : derive expected thaw extra metas address
AclGate -> AclGate : check extra_metas.key == expected
alt Invalid Extra Metas
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::InvalidExtraMetas
end

note over AclGate, WhitelistEntry
  CHECK 4: Validate Whitelist Entry PDA
end note

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs derive expected PDA]]
note right of WhitelistEntry
  Expected seeds: [
    "vault_whitelist_entry",
    mint.key(),
    token_account_owner.key()
  ]
  Program: VAULT_PROGRAM_ID
end note

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check actual_key == expected_key
alt Invalid Whitelist Entry PDA
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::InvalidWhitelistEntry
end

note over AclGate, WhitelistEntry
  CHECK 5: Validate Whitelist Status
end note

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs call is_whitelisted]]
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check owner == VAULT_PROGRAM_ID
alt Not Owned by Vault Program
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ return false (not whitelisted)
end

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check data not empty
alt Empty Account Data
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ return false (not whitelisted)
end

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs deserialize VaultWhitelistEntry]]
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check entry.mint == mint
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check entry.owner == token_account_owner
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check entry.whitelisted == true
alt Not Whitelisted
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::NotWhitelisted
  note over AclGate
    **Security Enforcement:**
    Transfer denied because
    owner is not whitelisted
  end note
end

note over AclGate
  CHECK 6: Validate Token Account
end note
AclGate -> AclGate : check token_account != Pubkey::default()
alt Invalid Token Account
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ InvalidAccountData
end

AclGate -> AclGate : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs all checks passed]]
AclGate --> TokenProgram : ✅ Ok() - Thaw allowed

TokenProgram -> SourceVToken : set frozen = false
TokenProgram -> User : ✅ Transfer proceeds

=== SCENARIO B: Freeze Request (Freeze Account) ==

AclGate -> AclGate : process_acl_instruction
note over AclGate
  Discriminator matches:
  CanFreezePermissionlessInstruction
end note

AclGate -> AclGate : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault-acl-gate/src/lib.rs can_freeze_permissionless]]

note over AclGate
  Same checks as thaw:
  1. assert_permissionless_flag
  2. vault_program == VAULT_PROGRAM_ID
  3. extra_metas PDA (freeze variant)
  4. whitelist_entry PDA derivation
end note

AclGate -> FlagAccount : assert_permissionless_flag
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : derive expected PDA
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : validate PDA matches
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : is_whitelisted check

alt Still Whitelisted
  AclGate --> TokenProgram : ❌ GateError::AlreadyWhitelisted
  note over AclGate
    Cannot freeze if still whitelisted
  end note
end

note over AclGate
  CHECK: Owner NOT whitelisted
  (whitelisted == false OR account closed)
end note

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : verify not whitelisted
AclGate -> AclGate : check token_account != Pubkey::default()
AclGate --> TokenProgram : ✅ Ok() - Freeze allowed

TokenProgram -> SourceVToken : set frozen = true
note right of SourceVToken
  vToken account frozen
  All transfers blocked
end note

TokenProgram -> User : ❌ Transfer denied (account frozen)


note over WhitelistEntry, SourceVToken
  **Security Model Summary:**
  
  1. vToken accounts start frozen by default
     (DefaultAccountState::Frozen on mint)
  2. Whitelist addition allows thaw
  3. Whitelist removal triggers freeze
     (account closed via exit())
  4. All transfers check whitelist via ACL Gate
  5. No bypassing whitelist enforcement
  6. FLAG_ACCOUNT must be funded and owned
     by Token ACL program
end note

@enduml
